SchurComplexes -- Schur functors of chain complexes
***************************************************

Description
===========

This package computes the Schur complex $S_{\lambda}F_{\bullet}$ associated to
a bounded chain complex $F_{\bullet}$ of finitely-generated free modules,  and
a partition $\lambda$. Our conventions are the transpose of the convention in
"Cohomology of Vector Bundles and Syzygies", by Jerzy Weyman, Chapter 2.4.



